WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.208
Follow the cycle from purpose to agreement, work, review and revision. Ask

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:08.417
whether the required result, authority, information and capacity remain clear as circumstances

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:12.625
change.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:16.508
Use what happened in the case to improve your working agreement and

00:00:16.508 --> 00:00:20.150
decision brief. Make a change specific, obtain the right confirmations and communicate

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:23.792
the current version.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.408
Your useful habit is to separate requests, decisions, actions and accepted arrangements.

00:00:28.408 --> 00:00:32.817
The next unit explores authority boundaries in greater depth; this unit does

00:00:32.817 --> 00:00:37.225
not replace workplace approval.
